        "text": "__osrt1__:{\"version\":1,\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CashPath provides an online entry point for consumers who want to explore \"},{\"type\":\"strong\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"personal loan options\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" without starting their search from scratch.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The process begins with a short request. You select a requested amount and provide the information needed to continue into the participating-provider flow. That information may then be evaluated by providers or networks according to their own eligibility, verification, credit, and underwriting criteria.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Submitting a request does not mean that a provider will make an offer. It also does not mean that an offer, if one becomes available, will match the amount you requested.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CashPath's role is to help begin the connection. The actual financial relationship, if you choose to proceed, is between you and the provider.\"}]}]}}",
