        "text": "__osrt1__:{\"version\":1,\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CashPath may modify, update, suspend, or discontinue features of the website.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We do not promise uninterrupted availability, error-free operation, or that every third-party integration will always remain available.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Temporary technical problems do not change any separate agreement you may have entered into directly with a provider.\"}]}]}}",
