        "title": "Information may change",
        "text": "__osrt1__:{\"version\":1,\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CashPath seeks to provide useful and understandable information, but financial terminology, provider practices, third-party integrations, laws, and website functionality can change.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If CashPath information conflicts with the actual terms of a provider offer, the provider's applicable disclosures and agreement control that transaction.\"}]}]}}",
