        "text": "__osrt1__:{\"version\":1,\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CashPath does not guarantee that funds will be provided or that funding will occur within a specific number of hours or days.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Provider review, additional verification, execution of documents, bank processing, weekends, holidays, and other factors may affect timing.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Any timing representation concerning a specific transaction should come from the provider.\"}]}]}}",
